      "heading": "A useful place to start, whatever your course.",
      "backgroundColor": "#F5F0E7",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "WHY JOIN A useful place to start, whatever your course. You do not need a business degree, a polished plan, or a perfect pitch. You just need some curiosity about how careers, ideas, and organisations work. We make room for the conversations and practical experience that help students move forward with more clarity. 01 Find your direction Make careers, industries, and next steps feel less abstract. 02 Build confidence Practise the skills that help ideas travel: speaking, presenting, interviewing, and leading. 03 Meet good people Connect with students who are curious about business, enterprise,",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "section",
      "type": "features",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1586,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 639,
      "heading": "Four ways to build momentum.",
      "backgroundColor": "#071A2D",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "WHAT WE FOCUS ON Four ways to build momentum. One society, four practical routes into a more confident future. 01 Careers Better context for applications, workplaces, and commercial roles. 02 Enterprise A place to test ideas, learn from others, and start building. 03 Networking More natural routes into conversations, peers, and professional communities. 04 Skills Useful practice in communication, strategy, collaboration, and leadership.",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
